@host = http://localhost:5000

### Все машины
GET {{host}}/cars

### Машина по id
GET {{host}}/cars/1

### Поиск по имени
GET {{host}}/cars?search=tes

### Регистрация
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Вход
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Бронирование (Range Rover, 3 дня, с водителем: 200*3+50 = 650)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "days": 3,
  "needsDriver": true,
  "location": "Baku"
}

### Профиль пользователя
GET {{host}}/users/1

### Сохранить профиль
PUT {{host}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phone": "+250 011 00 101",
  "birthDay": "08.09.2022",
  "gender": "Female"
}
